/target

# Un-ignore what ships, against the owner's global `*.md` ignore.
!CLAUDE.md
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!site/
!site/**

/site/node_modules/
/site/dist/
/site/.astro/

# Public files a later phase adds.
!LICENSE-*
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!docs/benchmarks.md

# Design and research working docs stay local; nothing here ships.
/docs/design/
/docs/research/

# Only the rules ship from .claude/; everything else is local working state.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/rules/
!/.claude/rules/**

__pycache__/
*.pyc
/logs/

# Root-level scratch markdown never ships, e.g. /lets-explainer.md.
/*.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
